# SPA catch-all: every path serves index.html and react-router takes over.
#
# Note this also swallows a request for a missing /assets/* file, handing back
# index.html with a 200. That used to blank the page (a stale chunk request got
# HTML the browser would not run as a module) — Pages ignores a 404 status here,
# so the fix was structural instead: main.jsx imports its routes statically, so
# nothing is fetched at runtime that index.html did not already name.
/*  /index.html  200
